<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Rothmans year net higher.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Rothmans year net higher.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		  (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 420.61	 vs	  357.50</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	147.0	  vs	  125.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		 1,763.71	vs	 1,596.65</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   559.65	vs	   509.76</p>
<p>    Dividend (ringgit)	 1.60	vs	     1.20</p>
<p>NOTE - Rothmans of Pall Mall (M) Bhd is a cigarette concern.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201 4813)</p>
</text>
